  4. Layer construction for pipeline

  Alpa has AutoLayerOption — an algorithm that automatically groups fine-grained operators into coarser "layers" (pipeline granularity units) by analyzing FLOPs balance. ColossalAI has no equivalent; the FX graph nodes map 1:1 to operators with
   no automatic layer grouping step.

